              "text": "le surlendemain — \"two days later, the day after next\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Il est arrivé le lundi et il est reparti le surlendemain. He arrived on the Monday and left again two days later."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sur + lendemain: one day beyond the next day."
            }
